{
  "id": "02-free-dp700-path",
  "title": "The free DP-700 preparation path",
  "duration": 38.6987,
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Want to prepare for DP seven hundred without buying a course? Start with Microsoft's own resources.",
      "asset": "dp700",
      "device": "tile",
      "key": "DP-700",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.8987,
      "voice_end": 5.7387
    },
    {
      "text": "First, open the Fabric Data Engineer certification page on Microsoft Learn.",
      "asset": "dp700",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 5.8987,
      "end": 10.8373,
      "voice_end": 10.6773
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the study guide to see the skills the exam measures.",
      "asset": "dp700",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 10.8373,
      "end": 14.0267,
      "voice_end": 13.8667
    },
    {
      "text": "Then work through the free, self paced learning material linked from that page.",
      "asset": "dp700",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 14.0267,
      "end": 18.112,
      "voice_end": 17.952
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the free practice assessment to find the areas you still need to study.",
      "asset": "assessment",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 18.112,
      "end": 22.3893,
      "voice_end": 22.2293
    },
    {
      "text": "Try the exam sandbox so the interface is familiar before exam day.",
      "asset": "assessment",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 22.3893,
      "end": 26.7947,
      "voice_end": 26.6347
    },
    {
      "text": "Preparation is free. An exam booking is a separate purchase unless you have a valid offer.",
      "asset": "dp700",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 26.7947,
      "end": 32.352,
      "voice_end": 32.192
    },
    {
      "text": "Save the official certification page. Check any voucher's eligibility and deadline before relying on it.",
      "asset": "dp700",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 32.352,
      "end": 38.6987,
      "voice_end": 38.5387
    }
  ],
